/*
 * This is a new combined armour and weapon code file.
 * for compability reasons weapon.c and armour.c will be saved
 * this file adds multislot support and unique eq saving system
 * THIS FILE IS SELFSUPPORTED. OTHER BASE FILES ARE FOR OLD CODE COMPABILITY
 *
